findings.finding:
Hospital policy is set from environment variables, the same for every hospital in the process:
- tax and discount codes and component definitions (TAX_*, DISCOUNT_*), with 18/12/5/0% slabs;
- rounding and precision;
- free-cancel windows for invoices, charge items and payments;
- encounter restart limit;
- patient identifier maintenance flags;
- PATIENT_GLOBAL_EDIT_ACCESS;
- PREFERENCE_SCHEMA, OTP limits and branding strings.
